  <name>OpenClonk</name>
  <summary>Multiplayer action game where you control small and nimble humanoids</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      OpenClonk is a free multiplayer action game in which you control clonks, small but witty and nimble humanoid beings. 
      The game is mainly about mining, settling and fast-paced melees.
    </p>
  </description>
